                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f5cbd6b3-dc62-3b7d-8d1b-e60b01af207f",
                        "entry_id": "c5be2173-66fa-314f-86f8-9b7934684a95",
                        "glosses": [
                            "van een persoon dat deze zich niet houdt aan de regels van een goed sporter"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "20fd3558-8380-43d8-9bfe-3af14058e4c4",
                                "sense_id": "f5cbd6b3-dc62-3b7d-8d1b-e60b01af207f",
                                "text": "\"Ik neem het niet persoonlijk op, maar ik vind het wel ontzettend onsportief. De organisatie wil dat er iets gebeurt, wat het ook is. Ze willen dat je verdwaald kunt raken. Voor mij heeft dit niets met sport te maken."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6a581f2d-4ec2-4a91-8ee9-d9f5e1054916",
                                "sense_id": "f5cbd6b3-dc62-3b7d-8d1b-e60b01af207f",
                                "text": "Dartsbond PDC, organisator van het WK, deelt regelmatig boetes uit voor ongewenst of onsportief gedrag op het podium. Taylor zal zich daar overigens vermoedelijk niet al te druk om maken. \"Ik ga nog steeds een fortuin verdienen\", zei de afscheid nemende 16-voudig wereldkampioen na zijn 7-2 nederlaag."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3ee97693-7ec2-48f7-9e09-ee7798028e03",
                                "sense_id": "f5cbd6b3-dc62-3b7d-8d1b-e60b01af207f",
                                "text": "„De Stichting X. is ooit opgericht om onsportief gedrag op en rond het veld tegen te gaan. Uiteindelijk is hier helaas niets mee gedaan en is de stichting slapende. Er is geen administratie, geen bankrekening, geen vergaderverslagen, geen boekhouding, helemaal niets, behalve de naam.” Dat schrijft Mueller in een verklaring."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "63612246-98d3-3e73-9b15-dd119c583894",
                        "entry_id": "c5be2173-66fa-314f-86f8-9b7934684a95",
                        "glosses": [
                            "van een persoon dat deze weinig aan sport doet"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c14e803b-061a-49d3-903b-410a2d7991d8",
                        "source_entry_id": "c5be2173-66fa-314f-86f8-9b7934684a95",
                        "source_sense_id": "f5cbd6b3-dc62-3b7d-8d1b-e60b01af207f",
                        "target_lang_word": "unsportsmanlike",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unsportsmanlike",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "61487372-8b8d-3d62-8c64-260c8cb47094",
                                        "entry_id": "b13f84cc-af18-3dc4-afc7-9a27d862caf7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Violating the accepted standards of sportsmanship."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3fdc0d5b-6102-422f-ae46-f12b6119f3b1",
                                                "sense_id": "61487372-8b8d-3d62-8c64-260c8cb47094",
                                                "text": "The ATP rulebook defines unsportsmanlike conduct as “any misconduct by a player that is clearly abusive or detrimental to the success of a tournament, ATP and/or the sport” and carries a fine of up to $20,000."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9c5dccf4-aa48-43ab-9fa8-ad8a176f89af",
                        "source_entry_id": "c5be2173-66fa-314f-86f8-9b7934684a95",
                        "source_sense_id": "f5cbd6b3-dc62-3b7d-8d1b-e60b01af207f",
                        "target_lang_word": "unsporting",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unsporting",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ca0e58f8-9313-3593-8008-56758aaf9986",
                                        "entry_id": "586bc726-d6d3-3152-bdec-57eca985a902",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "unfair, or not sportsmanlike"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b6157061-2232-3cd2-bfd3-d3b928d8d9b3",
                                        "entry_id": "586bc726-d6d3-3152-bdec-57eca985a902",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not taking part in sport; unsporty."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6465a8ac-019e-4209-ab71-8d749efb17bf",
                                                "sense_id": "b6157061-2232-3cd2-bfd3-d3b928d8d9b3",
                                                "text": "The bright, unsporting boy is labelled a swot, geek or nerd, the artist any other term that throws his masculinity into doubt."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9814bc1a-785e-464a-a4ad-c77b4fe62bc9",
                        "source_entry_id": "c5be2173-66fa-314f-86f8-9b7934684a95",
                        "source_sense_id": "f5cbd6b3-dc62-3b7d-8d1b-e60b01af207f",
                        "target_lang_word": "unfair",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unfair",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d3f57a64-012d-3f10-995d-d9266f7a24a0",
                                        "entry_id": "06e8c684-f747-36bf-bce6-53acbcfbea11",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "not fair, unjust"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "022dbd46-8d0d-4b2d-ac7d-bf45eda53b27",
                                                "sense_id": "d3f57a64-012d-3f10-995d-d9266f7a24a0",
                                                "text": "It was unfair for the boss to give larger bonuses to his friends."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ad30b41-a221-4f00-ae70-1b0926bb5ed5",
                                                "sense_id": "d3f57a64-012d-3f10-995d-d9266f7a24a0",
                                                "text": "He draws eclectically on studies of baboons, descriptive anthropological accounts of hunter-gatherer societies and, in a few cases, the fossil record. With this biological framework in place, Corning endeavors to show that the capitalist system as currently practiced in the United States and elsewhere is manifestly unfair."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6a190d7-d38d-4216-845e-7575f970fb3f",
                                                "sense_id": "d3f57a64-012d-3f10-995d-d9266f7a24a0",
                                                "text": "Cuphead built a reputation for difficulty before release, but its boss battles are mostly about recognizing patterns than getting lucky against unfair bosses. Watching players ace their way through the game’s bosses is a spellbinding reminder that even tough games can be defeated easily with hard work."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56f92c93-d6ef-4fb2-95c0-4ef8e6c5074f",
                                                "sense_id": "d3f57a64-012d-3f10-995d-d9266f7a24a0",
                                                "text": "Khan countered this by alleging that 'unfair' conditions, such as raising council tax, are being attached to any new funding deal that would \"punish Londoners\" for the effect the pandemic has had on passenger numbers. He added: \"These short-term deals are trapping TfL on life support rather than putting it on the path to long-term sustainability.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "272751c7-de15-3cc6-9fa9-108d3b730e0b",
                                        "entry_id": "06e8c684-f747-36bf-bce6-53acbcfbea11",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "not beautiful; uncomely; unattractive"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic",
                                            "rare"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
